<title>SWITZERLAND: SOCCER-SWITZERLAND BEAT LATVIA 1-0 IN FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SWITZERLAND BEAT LATVIA 1-0 IN FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>LUCERNE, Switzerland 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Switzerland beat Latvia 1-0 (halftime 0-0) in a friendly soccer international on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Adrian Kunz 90</p>
<p>Attendance: 9,100</p>
